  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You may touch an object within Melee range and <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to grant it the properties of a chosen enchantment of your Tier or lower. When attempting to place an enchantment on an item held or worn by an adversary, you must also make a <strong>Spellcast Roll</strong> against the target after marking a Stress. You can have only one enchantment active at a time, which last until the end of the scene, you enchant a different item or otherwise specified.</p><p><em>Use the action below (or the ✦ Wonder button on your sheet) to open the Enchanting Workshop.</em></p>",
